{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":45,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華使塞魯士興起"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"「我耶和華膏立塞魯士為王，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我牽著他的右手幫助他征服列國、降服列王；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我使城門洞開，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不再關閉。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我對他說，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『我要走在你前面，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為你夷平高山，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"打破銅門，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"砍斷鐵閂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要把隱藏的寶物和秘密收藏的財富賜給你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好叫你知道點名呼召你的是我——以色列的上帝耶和華。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雖然你不認識我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但為了我的僕人雅各，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我所揀選的以色列，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我還是點名呼召你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"賜給你一個尊貴的名號。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我是獨一無二的耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"除我以外再沒有上帝。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雖然你不認識我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我還是賜你力量。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這樣，從日出之地到日落之處，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"普天下都知道除我以外，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"別無他神，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我是獨一無二的耶和華。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我造光明，也造黑暗；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"賜平安，也降災禍。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這一切都是我耶和華的作為。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"「『諸天啊，要降下甘露，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雲彩要降下公義，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大地要裂開，萌生救恩和公義，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是我耶和華創造的。』","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"「跟造物主爭辯的人有禍了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他不過是世上瓦器中的一件。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"陶泥怎能對陶匠說『你在做什麼』？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"受造之物怎能說『造我的沒手藝』？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"對父親說『你生的是什麼』，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"或對母親說『你產的是什麼』的人有禍了！」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列的聖者和創造主耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「你們就我子民將來的事質問我嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們發號施令要告訴我如何做嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是我造了大地，又造了地上的人；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我親手鋪展穹蒼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"佈置天上的萬象。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我憑公義使塞魯士王興起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要讓他的道路暢通無阻。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他必重建我的城，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"釋放我被擄的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不是為了得報酬或獎賞。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是萬軍之耶和華說的。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「埃及的出產和古實的貨物必歸你所有。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"身材高大的西巴人必來歸附你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"戴著鎖鏈跟在你身後。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們要向你下拜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在你面前懇求，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並說，『上帝真的與你們同在，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂獨一無二，除祂以外，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"別無他神。』」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"救主——以色列的上帝啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你真是一位隱藏自己的上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"製造偶像的都必蒙羞受辱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一同陷入恥辱。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但以色列必蒙耶和華拯救，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"享受永遠的救恩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"永遠不會再蒙羞受辱。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"創造諸天、塑造和建立大地給人居住、沒有使地荒涼的耶和華上帝說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「我是獨一無二的耶和華。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我沒有在隱秘處暗暗地說話，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我沒有對雅各的後裔說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『你們徒然尋求我。』","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我耶和華宣揚真理，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"傳講正義。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"「列國的倖存者啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要聚集到這裡來。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那些抬著木頭神像、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向不能救人的神明禱告的人真無知！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要陳明你們的理由，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要彼此商議。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰早已預言過這一切？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰很久以前就說過這些預言？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難道不是我耶和華嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"除我以外別無他神。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我是公義的上帝，我是救主，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"除我以外別無他神。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"普世的人啊，歸向我吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們必蒙拯救，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我是獨一無二的上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我憑自己起誓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我口中的話真實可靠，絕不更改，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『萬膝必向我跪拜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬口必起誓效忠於我。』","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『只有耶和華那裡才有公義和能力。』」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向祂發怒的必在祂面前蒙羞。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列的後裔必被耶和華稱為義人，得到榮耀。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/45.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/46.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/44.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":25}